        "template--15859280478387__3749ef09-8d72-4248-89ad-730dbf87777f-1668911698b49c5cb3-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I noticed that people were avoiding buying flowers because they didn’t see the value in buying an arrangement that faded and dropped after a couple of days. </p><p>So I use my years of knowledge in the flower industry to select blooms in combinations that last. </p><p>And put them together in beautiful arrangements that give the wow factor to your gift, home, office or event. </p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
