    "caae1821-be14-42f5-bb46-4c48de80e0a3": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--15859280478387__caae1821-be14-42f5-bb46-4c48de80e0a3-166891237475173de6-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Beautiful, Easy To Order Flowers</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "template--15859280478387__caae1821-be14-42f5-bb46-4c48de80e0a3-166891237475173de6-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>- Market-Fresh.</strong> All our flowers are bought fresh every 2-3 days, so you get the longest-lasting, stunning flowers</p><p><strong>- 19+ years of flower-buying experience. </strong>Arranging flowers is one skill, but knowing how to buy the right blooms takes different knowledge. With over 19 years of experience, I know which flowers to buy to get the best value and the biggest wow factor for your arrangement. </p><p><strong>- Local to Auckland Eastern Bays. </strong>Being local means you can come and find me from Monday to Friday at 69A Merton Road, St John’s. And I can deliver easily around Remuera, Stonefields, Meadowbank and Ellerslie. </p><p><strong>- Totally obsessed with flowers. </strong>If you can’t decide or need advice on your flower choices, let’s talk. Come down to Mel’s Flower Truck, or email me with your questions. I can help you get the perfect flowers for any occasion.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
